================================================================================
Summary of modifications made by the Open Launcher project
================================================================================

Relative to the upstream Lawnchair `16-dev` branch, this fork has (among
other changes):

  * Replaced the application id, display name, deep-link URI scheme, and APK
    output naming ("Lawnchair" -> "Open Launcher" / app.lawnchair ->
    app.openlauncher); the internal Kotlin/Java package app.lawnchair and
    class names such as LawnchairLauncher were intentionally kept unchanged
    to minimize the diff against upstream (they are not user-visible).
  * Replaced the launcher icon (adaptive icon background/foreground/
    monochrome layers) with original, independently authored vector artwork;
    removed all raster Play Store / nightly-flavor icon assets.
  * Removed the "nightly" and "play" build flavors/channels, keeping only a
    single "github" channel (application id app.openlauncher).
  * Rewrote the in-app About screen to remove the core team / contributor
    list, GitHub contributor-activity fetching, avatar/imgur image loading,
    donation and OpenCollective links, Telegram/Discord/X community links,
    and the nightly build auto-updater (including its GitHub API polling and
    APK download/install flow); the About screen now only shows the app
    name, version, a link to this project's GitHub repository, an
    acknowledgements/licenses entry, and a notice that the app is a
    derivative of Lawnchair and AOSP Launcher3.
  * Removed the katbin.in crash-report upload feature from the bug-report
    flow; local crash capture and copy-to-clipboard remain available.
  * Removed the bundled Google Sans Flex variable font (proprietary, no
    license file was present in the upstream tree) and changed the default
    text/heading/body typefaces to resolve to the system default typeface.
  * Removed prebuilts/libs/libGoogleFeed.jar (unreferenced, unknown
    provenance).
  * Removed upstream-specific CI/community infrastructure (Crowdin
    workflows/config, OpenCollective/Telegram/Discord/nightly-release
    workflows, Fastlane store metadata, funding links) that pointed at
    Lawnchair's own infrastructure and is not applicable to this fork.
  * Rewrote README.md and issue templates for this project.

This is a summary for Apache License 2.0 Section 4(b) purposes and does not
list every changed line; see the git history of
https://github.com/wustar576/open-launcher for the complete set of changes.

